      "created_at": "2012-09-03T18:54:54.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I was looking through my rulebook and noticed a few problems with it.&nbsp; First was a minor spelling issue on page 5, using 'no-villain' instead of 'non-villain.'&nbsp; The next issue I saw is on page 6, where at the bottom of the page is listed a villain bio of the operative, but with a picture and description of the ennead.&nbsp; The third (and probably the biggest) issue is that page 8 and page 9 (except for the actual page numbers in the bottom corner) are exactly the same as page 6 and page 7, even with the same operative/ennead issue from page 6 on page 8.</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:36:07.830Z",
