      "created_at": "2012-09-28T02:13:46.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I've noticed all of that. The page thing is more of a logistical thing, really. It didn't have the right number of pages to make it staple right (It used 3 larger papers, stapled in the middle. You can't cut one in half - the book would fall apart) I suspect that is more of the issue. ^^</p>",
